Package: gonzocache
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: GonzOS Packaging <packages@gonzos.invalid>
Installed-Size: 51
Depends: runit
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: login-time application cache warmer and tracker
 gonzocache tracks application launches and warms frequently used executables
 and mapped files into the page cache.  It includes a runit tracker service
 and a desktop-login preload entry.
